{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/nirsm6rwg2cjdas9dwwvono9zlfmt9l.mp3","text":"博士的助理工作我已经轻车熟路啦。不过，别因为我这么说，就把所有事情都推给我哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/daizfp6zq07z2u86492wxnxwmdx9tia.mp3","text":"罗德岛的工作轻松多了，你不知道我在观测站有多忙！不但经常干到通宵，同事有问题也爱找我聊，还说什么推荐我去竞选主任......你说我肯定能做得很好？嗯哼——现在想这些还是太早啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/7x4nl3lhlrfte8eqqo0fasextmuw3ps.mp3","text":"谢拉格吗？我蛮喜欢那里的，大家都很照顾我。就是第一次和当地助手们合作测试源石样本时，他们突然集体低头，把我吓了一跳。后来才知道，他们是为了我和实验在向耶拉冈德祈祷。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/2jp8rww8h8ctg0lmnwzz0jm3k96z18r.mp3","text":"现在莱茵生命的同事们会半开玩笑地和新人聊起我的事，说我曾不顾源石液泄漏也要坚持记录数据，“然而够危险不意味着够重要”之类的。跟你说，其实我一直不服气，重不重要只有未来说了算。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/pmjqtgp5nqr1l1438g3j4sxrup4ilr1.mp3","text":"初雪是一位很好的朋友。我可能永远都不会像她和其他谢拉格人那样，对耶拉冈德抱有崇高的敬爱。不过，我能感受到他们澄澈而坚韧的内心，毋庸置疑，这是“神明的存在”。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/cejapw40s6enrafew42yhts50hpdi3e.mp3","text":"在谢拉格，有位研究员告诉我，他开始害怕任何新的发现，因为它往往会让已有的科学框架变得难堪。我知道，并不是每一个崇尚科学的人都崇尚进步，但我始终热爱新的可能。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/q4bcmst8nsxkgts2ngyvw41igg6t6vc.mp3","text":"我的父母，最近寄给了姐姐一封长信和许多家乡特产，让她一定要转交给我。尽管我还没有下定决心......不过想问一下博士，罗德岛有什么伴手礼适合送给有些古板的长辈吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/95/8diyp354bp0yyipqzv2x465ow1zq4jj.mp3","text":"嗯......啊，博士。这是姐姐给我的星图，我想结合谢拉格的观测数据修正一下......什么时候对星象学感兴趣了？这是前人的一种探索，即使上面有许多谬误，也不意味着它全无价值。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/99/kc840hl98bbes6tetqfxvkl20jt4xts.mp3","text":"在谢拉格，我第一次见证了无法理解的力量。在科学的道路上走得越远，也就意味着把未知的边界拉得越长......不用担心，我尊重所有对未知的解释，也坚信有一天我会祛除其中的神秘。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/2306rgacyg7snikqdlbb72y1hsdl4tv.mp3","text":"欸？博士睡着了吗？那我正好也去打个盹。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/2uo5qicg6cv5o27zd5nmqwekv8o997k.mp3","text":"博士，很高兴再次见面。我特地回顾了一遍在罗德岛上的生活工作流程，这次什么事我都能做得井井有条了。嗯？之前也对我很满意？嘿嘿......","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/sz6k23n2w9ca8mo3fvgk9tgbl74li55.mp3","text":"还有要提高的地方，回去有的忙了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:5/59/0ff0kawtz7wq8iqoyj87aive0dd1wbb.mp3","text":"奖章的款式还是老样子啊，很好看。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/eb45z3g63twhsn71zajso6zg2dvdm1b.mp3","text":"万物并不独立于我们而存在，我们观察并改变着一切——这是我对科学的信念。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/tvv3bhw0ta3mg9pz4qq3yzg3pqyqqra.mp3","text":"好久不见，又能和大家一同行动了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/cbnldud33m4ap4956qlgq01knzy9fet.mp3","text":"“更换火力位置！”......都背下来了，一定没问题。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/l856g2jcab3w93tvuqwqxm419mmoayf.mp3","text":"放心，我记得预定好的时间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/9f57ih8aw3mvrubvnaxsjen34tw3z6s.mp3","text":"接敌位置符合预期，拿起武器。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/dy03pdfoo75g9ejr25n9ejy0f7xy31x.mp3","text":"嗯，我在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/20/qqly18oximspufz88m95tq142ctmvdu.mp3","text":"战术不变？","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/6kgl5afqjb8digjwnctur14ek38wwil.mp3","text":"就位。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/06/dww5i754exx6z6dr2gq9yr9fi8kus0b.mp3","text":"我会努力的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/c64h4hj1h6o46w8otkdwhtrtlqwu7j1.mp3","text":"向黑暗倾诉我的星光。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/mysviwz2yd1xgl47kqwk0b6llga7oni.mp3","text":"这片防区由我负责。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/60/41pbk3tkmsjbwbnkke1k79q89wyyhwt.mp3","text":"我会阻止你们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/83khkjzq4gt1f5pmdtnmnrx7ryub8uv.mp3","text":"人能知晓的力量，绝无止境。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/i30nul7td30ruibe6gxqu409si0ifkq.mp3","text":"精彩的指挥！嗯？你是说我刚才的表现也......哎呀，只是这次我准备得比较充分嘛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/8s987yelsk90zxksp51u85akut1pgdk.mp3","text":"审慎谋划后达成预期的胜利，现在可以放松啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/0zsw7b3ksbjzslxg8zhubwxw466hbwc.mp3","text":"啊？这个变量......","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/bdmcmosgn9foy1sp0jge9q5yp0anrz5.mp3","text":"别担心啦，分析出问题就会有解决方法。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/k5rrkmc1z4eddjhkaxu9tcwr73w6qse.mp3","text":"先定个闹钟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/ac6rxr4dq1zxu5x54mx5jlqjsmw25si.mp3","text":"呜哇？！","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/qrw1bzdsz7pgq9oues2lkhrndialoud.mp3","text":"不要告诉别人我在这偷懒——你本来不知道的？啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/kf6sb4o2ts30f2hum0q44fo5uaegwci.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/7c9dt0x7vqj060p33bepxh92db2k4qx.mp3","text":"哈喽博士，我在实验室待迷糊了，出来透透气，你也是来休息的吗？嗯？新年快乐？都过零点了吗？！本来我还想和姐姐提前去买一些零食......先不管那么多了，新年快乐博士！","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/9rsd9sqkohn2td0n55tgc1pi6s5ph6q.mp3","text":"你好博士，有空去实验室看看我的新成果吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_1047_halo2/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/d4ovyql0nhedvvnik1b18h5atxktucg.mp3","text":"博士的助理工作我已经轻车熟路啦。不过，别因为我这么说，就把所有事情都推给我哦。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/hg75jsqwkvogwur3fsd7oh7gae1ufqu.mp3","text":"罗德岛的工作轻松多了，你不知道我在观测站有多忙！不但经常干到通宵，同事有问题也爱找我聊，还说什么推荐我去竞选主任......你说我肯定能做得很好？嗯哼——现在想这些还是太早啦。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/5c1l0m9zbotkhaujtync23hzfv8rueu.mp3","text":"谢拉格吗？我蛮喜欢那里的，大家都很照顾我。就是第一次和当地助手们合作测试源石样本时，他们突然集体低头，把我吓了一跳。后来才知道，他们是为了我和实验在向耶拉冈德祈祷。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/tilks7qcsmdxxcawhjqupfjorko9grv.mp3","text":"现在莱茵生命的同事们会半开玩笑地和新人聊起我的事，说我曾不顾源石液泄漏也要坚持记录数据，“然而够危险不意味着够重要”之类的。跟你说，其实我一直不服气，重不重要只有未来说了算。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/hesunuxveuub3ukqhx0vtug63uav148.mp3","text":"初雪是一位很好的朋友。我可能永远都不会像她和其他谢拉格人那样，对耶拉冈德抱有崇高的敬爱。不过，我能感受到他们澄澈而坚韧的内心，毋庸置疑，这是“神明的存在”。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/m6f0sg011gpdlksl9i8nf9wv44g4bwc.mp3","text":"在谢拉格，有位研究员告诉我，他开始害怕任何新的发现，因为它往往会让已有的科学框架变得难堪。我知道，并不是每一个崇尚科学的人都崇尚进步，但我始终热爱新的可能。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/hjnco4l99bp095rfckweae5blzevfeq.mp3","text":"我的父母，最近寄给了姐姐一封长信和许多家乡特产，让她一定要转交给我。尽管我还没有下定决心......不过想问一下博士，罗德岛有什么伴手礼适合送给有些古板的长辈吗？","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/2luzk7vg8dmrb2dfunilnhccwxj8g47.mp3","text":"嗯......啊，博士。这是姐姐给我的星图，我想结合谢拉格的观测数据修正一下......什么时候对星象学感兴趣了？这是前人的一种探索，即使上面有许多谬误，也不意味着它全无价值。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/rhyuav0prpi5i083h00capgioeqxk9o.mp3","text":"在谢拉格，我第一次见证了无法理解的力量。在科学的道路上走得越远，也就意味着把未知的边界拉得越长......不用担心，我尊重所有对未知的解释，也坚信有一天我会祛除其中的神秘。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/bmtyti398b72u0h3qj12tjcdp2gpnz6.mp3","text":"欸？博士睡着了吗？那我正好也去打个盹。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/l6gvofe7pe80rgxfgsmc54fnn1wcz46.mp3","text":"博士，很高兴再次见面。我特地回顾了一遍在罗德岛上的生活工作流程，这次什么事我都能做得井井有条了。嗯？之前也对我很满意？嘿嘿......","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/79p37n10zfzzwplcdw54xegi0hvu1tz.mp3","text":"还有要提高的地方，回去有的忙了。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/5wuf4dpbtxbfbqi7yzgb4h2fggkitht.mp3","text":"奖章的款式还是老样子啊，很好看。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/3kyuewsrk0xcn2wmjyhrsjvp52gr0el.mp3","text":"万物并不独立于我们而存在，我们观察并改变着一切——这是我对科学的信念。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/o0f1xln9tavfdfjakvjjpf8xroahx71.mp3","text":"好久不见，又能和大家一同行动了。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/i2vyq66x3xxm6n44ao6vc74ixz04vr2.mp3","text":"“更换火力位置！”......都背下来了，一定没问题。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/5qrqliq1mu0d77wbwgikleea7fgazap.mp3","text":"放心，我记得预定好的时间。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/ip0tx7te8v3w7ljc5l353p8m5hylpaz.mp3","text":"接敌位置符合预期，拿起武器。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/h6f310f2iwwzgltjkx40lj188m23v7a.mp3","text":"嗯，我在。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/15/5vs3k49gnfbwne37p7qykzg7trl6a91.mp3","text":"战术不变？","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/emv72cgzp07he92u6kxa99bod5hr9lg.mp3","text":"就位。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/takiv5eg6nxzzkjvusuyvx82qvyvfbl.mp3","text":"我会努力的。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/t39f7nth5z6t8ro7c0qpdvsz0qbuca7.mp3","text":"向黑暗倾诉我的星光。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/21/px7wxw6hvyg74oeqivpt55aig8rhez6.mp3","text":"这片防区由我负责。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/3klykdjfkaaes5a215716cf0qsrd1qc.mp3","text":"我会阻止你们。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/0ab6slszmg0ovnxjz4zndzsoomuszgq.mp3","text":"人能知晓的力量，绝无止境。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/g86crnn8umqvao1ul9m1at8ksz7md4e.mp3","text":"精彩的指挥！嗯？你是说我刚才的表现也......哎呀，只是这次我准备得比较充分嘛。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/42qt69d6u337vshzqe6uo8ctz8gwjc6.mp3","text":"审慎谋划后达成预期的胜利，现在可以放松啦。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/q4cyxwixocgf9amy55sv30inm2e1km6.mp3","text":"啊？这个变量......","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/h55b4cw44if8mewth97iak6srnvlmmb.mp3","text":"别担心啦，分析出问题就会有解决方法。","alt":"voice/char_1047_halo2/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/9atndtkk8uhgqrzvamjq9ix5yp46dmw.mp3","text":"先定个闹钟。",